<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1233" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄδηκτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not gnawed</i> or <i>worm-eaten</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				420
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); <i>not bitten</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.60
			</span></i>,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>unmolested</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				3
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				81
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.864c
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				448a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>unaffected, untouched</i>, by love, anger, etc., in Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mort.</u>
				34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pomp.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				11.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eun.
				<u>VS</u>
				p.495B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>not biting</i> or <i>pungent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.30
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος</span>
			<i>less stimulating</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
